  "url": "https://haste.health/fhir/TestScript/sof-fhirpath-09",
  "name": "sof-fhirpath-09",
  "title": "SQL on FHIR fhirpath: nested exists",
  "status": "active",
  "description": "fhirpath features Suite test 9 of tests/fhirpath.json (fhirpath), tagged shareable, in https://github.com/FHIR/sql-on-fhir.js at 238d9b2be4ad.",
  "contained": [
    {
